    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in introducing this charming two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment ideally situated in the secure & gated development of Kiltipper Gate, Dublin 24 right at the foot of the Dublin mountains. The location is next to none as you are within minutes of The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital, schools and leisure facilities. Transport links abound with the LUAS, N81 and M50 motorway all within minutes. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious interior living accommodation of c. 67 sqm comprises of entrance hallway with storage areas, large open plan living/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom. A double door from the kitchen area open onto a private patio which attracts the sun throughout the day. \r\n\r\nNumber 38 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners and has the potential to be a stunning apartment, the long list of additional features includes built in storage, two double bedrooms, fitted kitchen and electric heating. This property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers including first time buyers looking to take their first steps onto the property ladder but additionally will attract downsizers looking for that bit of comfort in this secure & gated community. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly advised, contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- C. 67 sqm \r\n- BER C3\r\n- Management fees c. 2,000 per annum \r\n- 2 bed / 2 bath \r\n- Situated on the ground floor \r\n- Great condition throughout \r\n- Tastefully decorated \r\n- Gated development \r\n- Private patio area to the rear\r\n- Ample parking\r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Ample storage \r\n- Two double bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Master ensuite \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Large open plan living/dining area \r\n- Very spacious apartment \r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Electric heating \r\n- No onward chain\r\n- Perfect for first time buyers \r\n- Great investment opportunity \r\n- Lovely home for downsizers \r\n- M50 motorway found merely minutes by car \r\n- The Luas easily accessible \r\n\r\nDirections - If travelling from The Square Shopping Centre towards Kiltipper - Follow Kiltipper Way and proceed straight through the roundabout of Marlfield Mall/Arcadia Bar & Restaurant. Take the third exit from the next roundabout and turn right. Proceed ahead and veer right into Kiltipper Gate."
      },
      {
